msgstr "消费级产品更容易买到"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:19
#: 9756310980ef43439793dc77dd5bc8bf
msgid "Pico Enterprise vs consumer"
msgstr "Pico 企业版与消费版"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:22
#: 77f7dd230e8a4436b0f6bd94263c937d
msgid "Pico **Enterprise** and Pico **consumer** are not the same SKU:"
msgstr "Pico **企业版** 与 Pico **消费版** 不是同一 SKU："

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:24
#: 2f7b6f29511447a69e6622cb13509564
msgid "Enterprise supports **USB shared networking (USB 网络共享)**."
msgstr "企业版支持 **USB 网络共享**。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:25
#: fbbae8c61cee43139af3aca7bb129ac7
msgid ""
"They use **different headset Apps** — do not install one App and expect "
"it to cover both."
msgstr "它们使用**不同的头显 App** — 不要安装一个 App 就期望同时覆盖两者。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:27
#: 5146cc4a0f0b44e497b739b7f0e22713
msgid ""
"fa-py-libraries documents XRoboToolkit as “XRoboToolkit App + PC Service”"
" vs browser WebXR (`./run.sh vr` / `./run.sh vr-xrt`). It does not "
"publish store links or ADB steps for either Pico edition."
msgstr ""
"fa-py-libraries 将 XRoboToolkit 记为「XRoboToolkit App + PC Service」对比浏览器 "
"WebXR（`./run.sh vr` / `./run.sh vr-xrt`）。它不为任一 Pico 版本提供商店链接或 ADB 步骤。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:30
#: b21c754fc42f46aeb4f4a627c4992431
