msgid "Modes"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:39
#: 4ec333b630bb4bf096fdc5511d5bec39
msgid ""
"Both Pico and Meta Quest support **WebXR (Vuer)** and **XRoboToolkit** "
"backends. Launch from **fa-py-libraries** (`./init.sh all` first). There "
"is no `./run.sh vr --mode` flag."
msgstr ""
"Pico 和 Meta Quest 都支持 **WebXR (Vuer)** 和 **XRoboToolkit** 后端。从 **fa-py-"
"libraries** 启动（先 `./init.sh all`）。没有 `./run.sh vr --mode` 参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:41
#: 54e17ec02e104a9abb076909c35ce97f
msgid "Web Mode (WebXR/Vuer)"
msgstr "Web 模式（WebXR/Vuer）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:43
#: 4e3fc440118a49babb4c5a9166174627
msgid ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr"
msgstr ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:48
#: 956d10202c9445fbaff42538dfdb8d52
msgid "Opens a WebXR session accessible from the VR headset browser."
msgstr "打开可从 VR 头显浏览器访问的 WebXR 会话。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:50
#: e446c68710c54a39b1afa0807bfe8edc
msgid "XRoboToolkit Mode"
msgstr "XRoboToolkit 模式"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:52
#: d870a7a77a13457894c95d81e7b782d0
msgid "Native application — lower latency, recommended for production:"
msgstr "原生应用——延迟更低，建议用于生产环境："

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:54
#: 78486e0a4a9740da98b22ec8b5f7b3ad
msgid ""
"./init.sh install-xrobotoolkit-pc-service\n"
"./init.sh install-xrobotoolkit\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt-service\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt"
msgstr ""
"./init.sh install-xrobotoolkit-pc-service\n"
"./init.sh install-xrobotoolkit\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt-service\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:61
#: 06e6b4c0f94041e99c28fddd7f9ce31e
msgid ""
"Requires the **edition-matching** XRoboToolkit App on the headset "
"(Enterprise ≠ consumer Pico App). `./run.sh vr-xrt-service stop` shuts "
"down the PC Service."
msgstr ""
"需要在头显上安装**与版本匹配**的 XRoboToolkit App（企业版 ≠ 消费版 Pico App）。`./run.sh vr-xrt-"
"service stop` 关闭 PC Service。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:63
#: 0031f5cf4aea4d10aee3ff435f77b1f0
msgid "Topics Published"
msgstr "发布的话题"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:65
#: cbaa40dc27e54ec9bb2571867a074a7d
msgid ""
"`xr_target_node` publishes the `/teleop/*` set for both backends. Names, "
"types, fields, and rates: [VR published "
"topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md#vr-published-topics)."
msgstr "`xr_target_node` 为两种后端发布 `/teleop/*`。名称、类型、字段和频率见 [VR 发布话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md#vr-published-topics)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:67
#: 4206dfab45b44fb69d926b33b78a3ba7
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:69
#: 5edf18d5df304e9387a3acbd739ab551
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Robot-side VR insertion is separate: set `enable_vr: true` in the "
"description’s `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` (most robots default "
"off). Same file: `vr_update_rate`, `vr_follow_frame`. Button map "
"(including WBC stop-one-arm vs VR pause) and follow-frame "
"troubleshooting: {ref}`stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands`. The "
"latched mode for that session is `teleop/mode_state`: {ref}`teleop-mode-"
"status`."
msgstr ""
"机器人侧的 VR 接入是另一处：在描述包 `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 中设置 `enable_vr: "
"true`（多数机型默认关闭）。同一文件还有 `vr_update_rate`、`vr_follow_frame`。按键表（含 WBC 停单臂与 "
"VR 停发指令）与跟随坐标系排查见 {ref}`stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-"
"commands`。该会话锁存的模式在 `teleop/mode_state`：{ref}`teleop-mode-status`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:71
#: f04c9903ac064592a53a7a8137de7e7a
msgid "Network Setup"
msgstr "网络设置"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:73
#: 544a0277f5cc484cb12aa32f2b954d07
msgid ""
"**Pico Enterprise:** USB shared networking (USB 网络共享) can put the headset"
" and PC on one network. Use the headset UI; no ADB steps here."
msgstr "**Pico 企业版：** USB 网络共享可将头显与电脑放在同一网络。使用头显界面；此处不写 ADB 步骤。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:74
#: 2d5fe14b6f744db6bcbe43db14ecc147
msgid "**Pico consumer / Quest:** Wi-Fi (or other IP) only for this doc."
msgstr "**Pico 消费版 / Quest：** 本文仅记录 Wi-Fi（或其他 IP）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:76
#: 63b97cab012a43338f69a60049448fda
msgid ""
"If the VR device is on a different network: Zenoh or DDS discovery, "
"firewall, matching Domain IDs."
msgstr "若 VR 设备在不同网络：使用 Zenoh 或 DDS 发现、防火墙、匹配的 Domain ID。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:78
#: 15213a87aaec4bb4bc4ad1c74673afb2
msgid "Certificates"
msgstr "证书"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:80
#: 076a46e8674d489fa4c29ed008ead1e4
msgid "Security Note"
msgstr "安全说明"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:83
#: 424fe983589d43c2b70629524655aec1
msgid ""
"WebXR requires HTTPS. Certificates are user-generated and should not be "
"committed to version control."
msgstr "WebXR 需要 HTTPS。证书由用户自行生成，不应提交到版本控制。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:86
#: beaf2b57ce2b4aa1975eced174606e07
